    "title": "Historic Missouri Theater to offer public tours in November - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago\nST. JOSEPH, Mo. — The Missouri Theater will host three guided tours in November to give the public a look inside the historic performance center, city officials announced Wednesday. Tours will begin Monday at 2 p.m. and 3 p.m. A third tour is scheduled for 6 p.m. Nov. 17.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
